"en-GB\",\"uploadDate\":\"2022-10-01T00:00:00+00:00\",\"description\":\"Voiceover artist Guy Harris voice work for the FIFA 22 Sheffield FC 'No GOAT Without the FOAT' advertising campaign. Click to find out more!\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"FIFA 22: <i>No GOAT Without the FOAT</i>"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Celebrating the <i>First of All Time</i> with FIFA 22.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/pantomime-dame-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Pantomime Dame Voice - Oh Saucy!","aria-label":"Previous: Pantomime Dame Voice - Oh Saucy!","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/virtual-voiceover-studio-online","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Virtual Voiceover Studio","aria-label":"Next: Virtual Voiceover Studio","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Voice work for the recent <i>FIFA 22</i> ‘No GOAT Without the FOAT’ promo.</h2>\r\n<p>I do love voicing promos and was especially delighted to recently do work for <i>Fifa 22</i>. I’ve no shortage of experience when it comes to doing <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">voice work for games</a>, but collaborating with FIFA on a promo was a real treat given they’re the biggest sports game in the business. My previous football-related pieces have almost always seen me using my <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voiceover\">football commentator voice</a> but this FIFA promo, centred around Sheffield FC’s trailblazing 1857 team, was really unique and a lot of fun to do. \r\n"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_Ej_UZ3So1c","title":"FIFA 22: <i>No GOAT Without the FOAT</i>","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/fifa-22-goat-foat-sheffield-fc-promo-voice.jpg","alt":"fifa-22-goat-foat-sheffield-fc-promo-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"FIFA 22: <i>No GOAT Without the FOAT</i>"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Whats new in FIFA 22?</h2>\r\n<p>Players of the PC game FIFA 22 can now unlock the original Sheffield FC jersey from 1857 in Ultimate Team (FUT) mode. In addition, the club and FIFA manufacturer EA Sports are calling on gamers to commit to the \"FOAT code\". These are new and unwritten FIFA rules. FIFA players can express their commitment to this by wearing the historic Sheffield shirt in-game. There's not much to say about <a href=\"https://www.ea.com/sports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"EA Sports\">EA Sports’s</a> legendary FIFA game series that hasn't been said before. Having been one of the most anticipated releases on the gaming calendar every year since 1993, the FIFA games series has sold over 325 million copies across 51 countries, making it far and away the most successful sports video game franchise in the world. This promo inspired by the <i>FOAT</i> (First of All Time) combined all the humour and attitude you expect from an EA Sports ad campaign! </p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a voiceover artist with a wealth of experience and <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\"> wide range of characters</a> to contribute to your next promo? Maybe you're even in need of a narrator for your latest <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer\">computer game trailer</a>? Well I'd love to hear from you, so please feel free to get in touch. If you'd like to ensure I'm the right fit for your job, send me a few lines from your script and I can make a sample recording. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"FIFA 22: <i>No GOAT Without the FOAT</i>","pageUrl":"fifa-22-goat-foat-sheffield-fc-promo-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","544",{"href":"/gibtelecom-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/gibtelecom-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Gibtelecom Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Malta's Gibtelecom Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","768",{"href":"/compare-my-wedding-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/compare-my-wedding-voice.jpg","alt":"compare-my-wedding-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-titl